"text":"To uninstall:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## State mapping"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Priority | Session condition | Pet state |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 1 | Removed | Blocked |\n| 2 | Approval"},{"id":"p15s2","text":", plan review, or question pending | Needs input |\n| 3 | Running | Working |\n| 4 | Explicit open, ag"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ent, or prompt error | Blocked |\n| 5 | A running session stops successfully | Complete for 1600 ms |"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"\n| 6 | No session, cold/loading, or settled | Idle |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Idle assets, frame order, and interaction timing have one source of truth in `src/client/idle-animat"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ion.json`. `pnpm assets:check` enforces the 700,000-byte runtime WebP budget; the current set uses 6"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"79,044 bytes, so review asset size before adding more artwork."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"See CONTRIBUTING.md for artwork and verification rules."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Privacy and licenses"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The plugin reads only current-session status and provider-declared presentation metadata. It does no"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"t read tool arguments, prompts, model reasoning, or conversation text, and it makes no analytics req"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"uests. Preferences stay in browser-local storage."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Code is licensed under MIT. Artwork is licensed under CC BY 4.0; provenance and hashes are recorded "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"in ASSET_ATTRIBUTION.md."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
